          "type": "text",
          "text": "Student engineers noted a narrow foundation beside drainage while preparing a replacement frame. A safety brace in the laboratory equipment stand forms a right triangle. Its hypotenuse is 41 m and one shorter side is 9 m. Find the other shorter side in metres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "4.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
